{% comment %}
  Post pages: a "Buy me a coffee" pill that stays at the bottom-right of the post body
  while you read, and rests at the end of the post (_sass/_support.scss). On other pages
  the fixed pill in footer.liquid is used instead. The support-link class keeps it out of
  the read-aloud audio (_tts/generate.py SKIP list).
{% endcomment %}
<div class="bmc-dock support-link">
  <a class="bmc-pill" href="https://buymeacoffee.com/qhxzwtlpds" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg class="bmc-cup" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M8.2 3.2c0-.7.6-1.2 1.2-1.2h5.2c.7 0 1.2.5 1.2 1.2v1H8.2z" fill="#fff" stroke="#0d0c22" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M6.4 4.2h11.2l-1.3 15.3a2 2 0 0 1-2 1.8H9.7a2 2 0 0 1-2-1.8z" fill="#fff" stroke="#0d0c22" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M6.9 9.6h10.2M7.3 14.4h9.4" stroke="#0d0c22" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><span class="bmc-label">Buy me a coffee</span></a>
</div>
